note "eval-coverage-3 first references of the image effect (a 3:2 PNG, fit: cover, its box 16 to 30 wide), read: alone and in every pair the 16 x 12 decode (24 x 18 at 1.5, 32 x 24 at 2) stands in centred and keeping its aspect while the box springs, the decode of the new size lands once it rests, and under reduced motion it snaps; no redraw finding once the image's clip group is bounded where it draws (strand-render)"
